---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageIntro from "../components/PageIntro.astro";

const pageTitle = "About Me";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <PageIntro eyebrow="A little introduction" title="Hello, I’m Vladislav." />
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      You can call me Vla. I'm a full-time software engineer with interests
      beyond code.
    </p>

    <p>
      Born in Russia, I've spent significant time living in Vietnam and Georgia.
      Those stays have given me firsthand experience with their cultures and
      everyday life, beyond a tourist's perspective.
    </p>

    <p>
      Outside work, I manage my own portfolio across stocks, indices, and
      cryptocurrencies, occasionally trading using Inner Circle Trader (ICT)
      concepts. What interests me is how markets behave, what drives economic
      decisions, and the psychology behind price movements.
    </p>

    <p>
      Manga translation is a creative side project. On MangaDex, I contribute as
      a solo scanlator under an anonymous account, mainly working on English
      translations, with some Russian ones too.
    </p>

    <p>
      This website is a place to share projects, things I've learned, and
      whatever catches my attention. Feel free to stick around and explore.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
